  "version": "0.1.0",
  "mcpName": "io.github.fpavia111-creator/fairgive-duplicate-donors",
  "description": "Fairgive Duplicate Donors: finds likely duplicate donor records in a constituent export by e-mail, phone, address and name similarity, with the gifts on each record. Writes a merge worklist for a person. Never merges or deletes records.",
